  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">BRIDGE Rapid/Flexible Technical Assistance Fund</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Flexible Technical Assistance Fund will support the Ministry of Education&apos;s response to arriving needs and also for the British Embassy Amman Education Team to provide short-term expertise and/or conduct research as and when needed. As a lesson learned from COVID-19, a flexible Technical Assistance approach is needed to rapidly response to emergencies.</narrative>
  </description>
